{"id":105,"name":"marowak","speciesId":105,"dex":105,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["ground"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":80,"defense":110,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":80,"speed":45},"abilities":[{"name":"rock-head","hidden":false},{"name":"lightning-rod","hidden":false},{"name":"battle-armor","hidden":true}],"height":10,"weight":450,"baseExp":149,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/105.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/105.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/105.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/105.ogg","genus":"Bone Keeper Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"The bone it holds is its key weapon. It throws the bone skillfully like a boomerang to KO targets."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Small and weak, this POKéMON is adept with its bone club. It has grown more vicious over the ages."},{"version":"gold","text":"It has been seen pounding boulders with the bone it carries in order to tap out mes­ sages to others."},{"version":"silver","text":"It collects bones from an unknown place. A MAROWAK graveyard exists somewhere in the world, rumors say."},{"version":"crystal","text":"Somewhere in the world is a ceme­ tery just for MAROWAK. It gets its bones from those graves."},{"version":"ruby","text":"MAROWAK is the evolved form of a CUBONE that has overcome its sadness at the loss of its mother and grown tough. This POKéMON’s tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A MAROWAK is the evolved form of a CUBONE that has grown tough by overcoming the grief of losing its mother. Its tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is small and was originally very weak. Its temperament turned ferocious when it began using bones."},{"version":"diamond","text":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It has been seen pounding boulders with the bone it carries in order to tap out messages to others."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It collects bones from an unknown place. Some whisper that a MAROWAK graveyard exists somewhere in the world."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Marowak is the evolved form of a Cubone that has overcome its sadness at the loss of its mother and grown tough. This Pokémon’s tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken."},{"version":"sun","text":"Originally, it was weak and timid. After evolution, its temperament becomes violent, and it begins to wield bones as weapons."},{"version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon is out for vengeance on its natural enemy, Mandibuzz. It throws bones like boomerangs to try to take it down."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It throws bones at Mandibuzz to knock it down. It’s thought that Marowak is trying to avenge its parent."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"They thump their bones rhythmically to communicate among themselves. There are nearly 50 different rhythmic patterns."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Small and weak, this Pokémon is adept with its bone club. It has grown more vicious over the ages."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon overcame its sorrow to evolve a sturdy new body. Marowak faces its opponents bravely, using a bone as a weapon."},{"version":"shield","text":"When this Pokémon evolved, the skull of its mother fused to it. Marowak’s temperament also turned vicious at the same time."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["monster"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"cubone","speciesId":104,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28","Nível 28, À noite"],"species":"marowak","speciesId":105,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":105,"name":"marowak","form":"normal","sprite":"htt